                                "sense_id": "9324c215-0b05-39ff-ac2c-299bb2d13421",
                                "text": "Subscription and fan donations can enable creators with even modest audience sizes to earn substantial amounts. These direct fan payment models facilitate greater monetization of highly-engaged superfans, in contrast with ad-based models that reward scale and reach."
                            }
                        ]
